      <td class="docs-table__number mark mark--framework">{% icon "cpu" %}</td>
      <td><code class="status-pass">PASS</code>, <code class="status-fail">FAIL</code> or <code class="status-error">ERROR</code>. Assign it directly only for <code class="status-error">ERROR</code> - see <a class="text-accent" href="/framework/statuses/#setting-a-status">Setting a status</a>.</td>
